# The website (anyplay-gg/web) on the cloud's host name: the landing page at the root, the sign-in,
# sign-up and account pages, the page the launcher's account button opens, the public profiles, the
# join pages that the links on a player's Discord profile open, and the files they load. Every other path, the APIs and the older pages under /web included, stays
# with the cloud; the older account page sends people to the new one.
@website path / /sign-in /create /link /account /account/* /u/* /join/* /_next/* /icon.svg /favicon.ico
handle @website {
	reverse_proxy web:3000
}
redir /web/account /account 302
